      "type": "heading",
      "text": "[ K-IG 교육 Reading 007 ]"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "My belief is that all music has an expressive power, some more and some less,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hints",
      "text": "but that all music has a certain meaning behind the notes."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "That meaning constitutes what the piece is saying."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "This whole problem can be stated quite simply by asking,"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "\"Is there a meaning to music? \" My answer to that would be,"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "\"Yes.\" And \"Can you state in so many"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "words what the meaning is?\" My answer to that would be,"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "\"No.\" Therein lies the difficulty."
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        "1 번",
